class Solution {public:vector<int> solve(int n,vector<vector<int>> edges){vector<int>d(n,-1),ways(n);if(!n)return ways;vector<vector<int>>adj(n);for(auto e:edges)adj[e[0]].push_back(e[1]);queue<int>q;q.push(0);d[0]=0;ways[0]=1;while(!q.empty()){int u=q.front();q.pop();for(int v:adj[u]){if(d[v]<0){d[v]=d[u]+1;q.push(v);}if(d[v]==d[u]+1)ways[v]=(ways[v]+ways[u])%1000000007;}}return ways;}};